<translate>
==== ItemWhenDry ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
The parameter specifies the item that the original item will be replaced with after drying.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ItemWhenDry = Base.BathTowel,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

